ign.','The building shall have low flow sanitary fixes for water conservation and number of fixtures to comply with local building by laws.','The electrical fittings and lightings shall be provided as per NBC (National Building Code) Norms.','This is a commercial retail project and hence no kitchen is to be provided by the promoters. Incase of restraunts / F & B tenants  kitchen shall be provided by the tenants themselves.','N','','','On-going','2022-04-01 00:00:00.000','2025-03-31 00:00:00.000','2025-03-31 00:00:00.000','0 year(s) 0 month(s) 1 day(s)','','Hampton Court Business Park','NH 05 Ludhiana Chandigarh Road',28,366,27,'141123',7,'http://www.riteshindustries.us','Sanjeev ','','Arora','Hampton Court Business Park','NH 05, LDH CHD Road',28,366,'141123','riteshlimited8@gmail.com',9212359076,'Y','','Y','N','',1200.00,'//NREGC////NEXTRA//////','',2,0,'HAMPTONPLAZA','2022-03-08 19:23:37.000','HAMPTONPLAZA','2022-03-08 19:23:37.000',2302,'5806558e-d477-42d2-8a62-9e1019e731fd');
