,'Y','Doors & Windows, Plumbing, Security','Door & Windows: Engineered main door with engineered/timber frame, All Internal doors will be Premium Laminated Flush doors with engineered frames, Stainless steel/ Brass finished hardware fittings and locks of branded makes. Door Frames and Window Panels of Aluminum/ UPVC sections. Plumbing: As per standard practice, all internal plumbing in GI/ CPVC. All external in CI/ UPVC. Security: Video Door Phone, Biometric Door lock on Entry Door.','Complete','2022-11-01 00:00:00.000','2029-10-31 00:00:00.000','2029-10-31 00:00:00.000','0 year(s) 0 month(s) 1 day(s)','','Village Budmajra','Sector 121',28,507,23,'160055',1,'','Deepak','','Khanna','Casa Espana, Village Budmajra','Sector 121',28,507,'160055','deepak.khanna@atsgreens.com',9041013413,'Y','','N','N','',5014291000.00,'//NREGC////NEXTRA//////','',2,0,'reraibpb','2022-05-17 15:28:30.000','reraibpb','2022-05-17 15:28:30.000',1256,'ba9c278a-ce39-462b-8b79-62ea74ec44ea'),(4122,11521,'Shiva Enclave','Water Supply, Street Lighting','Y','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0233','NA','NA','NA','NA','NA','NA','N','','','On-going','2005-05-19 00:00:00.000','2018-12-14 00:00:00.000','2018-12-14 00:00:00.000','0 year(s) 0 month(s) 1 day(s)','','Village Khanpur','',28,507,22,'140301',2,'','SUBHASH','','BANSAL','3017, 21D','',6,128,'160022','BANSALGROUP3@GMAIL.COM',9888086858,'Y','','N','N','',100.00,'//NREGC////NEXTRA//////','',1,1,'GBMColonizersPrivateLimited','2022-05-17 15:40:51.000','GBMColonizersPrivateLimited','2022-05-17 15:40:51.000',2376,'3fb686ae-92d9-4bba-84fc-73cd1e563242'),(4123,11522,'Noor Homes','WATER SUPPLY, STREET LIGHTING','Y','PBRERA-SAS80-PR0219','RCC','MARBLE','CEMENTED','MODULAR','ISI','MODULAR','N','','','On-going','2015-03-03 00:00:00.000','2019-03-31 00:00:00.000','2019-03-31 00:00:00.000','0 year(s) 0 month(s) 1 day(s)','','VILLAGE SANTEMAJRA, KHARAR','',28,507,22,'140301',2,'','Ajay','','Gupta','402, Shivalik City, Sector 127, Kharar','',28,507,'160055','AJAYGUPTAGGP@GMAIL.COM