nd distemper in elegant shades External walls are coated with weather proof texture paint or exterior emulsion to protect the building from Punjab weather conditions Bathrooms feature glazed ceramic tiles up to seven feet height for a clean and hygienic look','Bathrooms are equipped with branded CP fittings and high quality white chinaware with concealed plumbing for a modern look Electrical systems include modular switches and ISI marked concealed copper wiring with sufficient points for air conditioning geysers and television sets All fittings meet the safety standards required for residential housing in Jalandhar','​All electrical installations feature high quality ISI marked modular switches and sockets from reputed brands like Havells or Anchor. The project utilizes concealed copper wiring with heat resistant properties to ensure maximum safety. Dedicated circuits are provided for air conditioners geysers and kitchen appliances with individual MCB protection for every room. The colony is equipped with LED street lighting and underground cabling as per PSPCL norms to provide a safe and reliable power.','Modern kitchen design featuring a polished granite counter top with a double bowl stainless steel sink Ceramic wall tiles are provided up to two feet above the counter for easy cleaning The space is designed with provisions for a chimney water purifier and modular cabinets to suit modern lifestyle needs within the colony','N','','','On-going','2026-02-17 00:00:00.000','2026-06-10 00:00:00.000','2026-05-28 00:00:00.000','0 year(s) 0 month(s) 14 day(s)','Delay in carry out construction activities , Cost Overrun or lack of funds, Shortage of construction materials, ','Dhatts,Town house,Wadala','near Youth Voice Foundation Society',28,261,16,'144001',1,'https://www.youthvoicefoundation.org','Gagandeep','Singh','Dhatt','Dhatts,180 civil lines','Near Youth Voice Foundation Society registered address',28,261,'144001','gagandhatt@gmail.com',9815078500,'Y','','N','N','',5